# Wave discipline

Follow `docs/waves.md` and the matching file in `prompts/`.

R0 is contracts and versions only. Do not implement scanner, parser, server, or UI during R0.

A failed security or data-correctness gate blocks the next wave. Do not fake engine output with fixture JSON in a demo.

Do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks. Never force-push. Never edit Tripwire.
